 "sentences": [
  {
   "first": 0,
   "last": 9,
   "start": 5.4,
   "end": 13.74,
   "text": "Endangered Animals Today, there are some endangered animals on Earth."
  },
  {
   "first": 10,
   "last": 22,
   "start": 13.74,
   "end": 17.46,
   "text": "It means that we can find only a few of them around us."
  },
  {
   "first": 23,
   "last": 31,
   "start": 17.46,
   "end": 22.5,
   "text": "Some examples are whales, pandas, tigers and Asian elephants."
  },
  {
   "first": 32,
   "last": 45,
   "start": 22.5,
   "end": 28.76,
   "text": "Humans destroy the natural homes of the animals in the forests, lakes, and plains."
  },
  {
   "first": 46,
   "last": 59,
   "start": 28.76,
   "end": 33.9,
   "text": "When the number of people on Earth increases, they need more places for living."
  },
  {
   "first": 60,
   "last": 66,
   "start": 33.9,
   "end": 36.46,
   "text": "They cut down trees and destroy lakes."
  },
  {
   "first": 67,
   "last": 72,
   "start": 36.46,
   "end": 38.92,
   "text": "They make homes and roads instead."
  },
  {
   "first": 73,
   "last": 81,
   "start": 38.92,
   "end": 41.98,
   "text": "Then the animals won't have a place to live."
  },
  {
   "first": 82,
   "last": 85,
   "start": 41.98,
   "end": 43.26,
   "text": "They will die out."
  },
  {
   "first": 86,
   "last": 92,
   "start": 43.7,
   "end": 46.4,
   "text": "The Iranian cheetah is among these animals."
  },
  {
   "first": 93,
   "last": 102,
   "start": 46.4,
   "end": 49.68,
   "text": "This wild animal lives only in the plains of Iran."
  },
  {
   "first": 103,
   "last": 111,
   "start": 49.68,
   "end": 53.1,
   "text": "Now there are only a few Iranian cheetahs alive."
  },
  {
   "first": 112,
   "last": 126,
   "start": 53.1,
   "end": 58.14,
   "text": "If people take care of them, there is hope for this beautiful animal to live."
  },
  {
   "first": 127,
   "last": 145,
   "start": 58.14,
   "end": 68.5,
   "text": "Recently, families pay more attention to nature, students learn about saving wildlife, and some hunters don't go hunting anymore."
  },
  {
   "first": 146,
   "last": 159,
   "start": 69.58,
   "end": 73.16,
   "text": "In this way, the number of cheetahs is going to increase in the future."
  }
 ],
